 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "WindowedKeyValueStore(capacity, windowSize). put(key,val,time) updates value and time of an existing key or inserts it; either way the key becomes most recently used; inserting beyond capacity evicts the least recently used key. get(key,time) returns the value if the key is stored and time - storedTime < windowSize (one-minute units), marking it most recently used; otherwise -1 with no change. Expired keys stay until evicted or overwritten. Times are non-decreasing across calls.",
  "provenance": [
